insert into Diary values ('61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509', '', 'Sapper Arthur Carpenter', 'Local: WW1 Diary')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B712F351-EFC2-4424-1A5C-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-21 07:20:00.0000000', 'Sandwich, UK', 'May 21st 1918, I left Sandwich for Southampton at 8.20 AM.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('1E5128FE-F162-4D8B-1A5D-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-21 14:00:00.0000000', 'Southampton, UK', 'I arrived at Southampton at 3 PM and left Southampton at 8 PM on board the Antrim for France.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('03901FEA-BA5C-4EFF-1A5E-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-22 02:30:00.0000000', 'Le Harve, France', 'I arrived at Le Harve at 3.30 AM on May 22nd. We walked about four miles to a Rest Camp where we had our dinner or ‘at least’ it was called a dinner. We had some white bread the first for years and it was lovely. I just managed to get a couple of bottles of beer which went down very good indeed. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('AF59B9C4-07CE-4EF8-1A5F-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-22 15:00:00.0000000', 'Le Harve, France', 'We left Le Harve at 4 PM by train for Marseilles Passing through a very pretty part of France and was stopped on the way at midnight on May 22nd by an air Raid on Paris.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('C93F150D-47F6-4B53-1A60-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-23 10:00:00.0000000', 'Train, France', 'We had some biscuits and bully beef about 11 AM, the first food for 22 hours in fact all the time we were in the train we were fed once a day. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('6B2A8642-72A0-426A-1A61-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-23 23:00:00.0000000', 'Marseilles, France', 'We arrived at Marseilles at midnight on Friday May 24th and slept in the train for the rest of the night.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('FDC09682-3861-47A6-1A62-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-25 09:00:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Another Biscuit for Breakfast and fall in to march to the rest camp. About 2 miles we Reached the rest camp in the morning of May 25th very tired and thirsty.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('028371E0-2FA9-47BC-1A63-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-26 11:00:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Sunday May 26th me and my chum went for a walk by the sea front had 2 bottles of wine at 1/8 per large bottle, very good.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8A081A04-0DC8-4189-1A64-08DE012FB313', '1918-05-27 11:00:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Monday May 27th cleaned up our camp and went for a walk along the sea front again. Very pretty place and very nice wine.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B4596A7E-9E8B-4207-4506-08DE0132BE20', '1918-05-28 11:00:00.0000000', 'Marseilles, France', 'Tuesday May 28th we had a day in Marseilles and had a good time. It is a very pretty city very fine buildings and very nice wine. Wine is very cheap here, but beer is 1 and 10 per pint bottle but very good. I met some boys from off a ship all from Southampton and had a lively hour with them, but we had to be back in camp by 8.30 PM which we were and quite sober after having a splendid time.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('1EB58DB9-9776-40F1-8923-08DE03520F77', '1918-05-29 11:00:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Wednesday May 29th had a nice quiet day in Camp and had sports and racing in the evening', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('F9367DB8-B3E9-454C-8924-08DE03520F77', '1918-05-30 17:50:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Thursday May 30th nobody allowed to leave the Camp special parade at 6.50PM 14 men were absent so nobody allowed to leave the Camp next day.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('127DEA34-9440-4175-8925-08DE03520F77', '1918-05-31 16:00:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'Friday May 31st had a splendid boxing competition in the evening and saw some good fighting by the black men. Nobody to leave the camp, under orders to pack up our bit to go away. Special parade at 5PM told we are leaving Rest Camp next day at 12.45 PM.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('99DCF9E4-4B10-4125-8926-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-01 11:50:00.0000000', 'Rest Camp, Marseilles, France', 'June 1st up very early in the morning rolled our blankets ready for return to the stores. Left rest camp for docks at 12.50 PM. Put on Board SS Ormonde for work in the docks as there is a dockers strike on here.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('0570736A-9678-4670-8927-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-02 12:30:00.0000000', 'SS Ormonde, Marseilles, France', 'Sunday June 2nd told off for work as a steward to start work at 1.30PM had the morning off', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('573A6ABA-4D14-4F4A-8928-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-03 06:00:00.0000000', 'SS Ormonde, Marseilles, France', 'Monday June 3rd start work at 7AM until midday, afternoon off, evening in Marseilles. Had a good time ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('736DC7DC-5DA6-4732-8929-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-04 10:00:00.0000000', 'SS Ormonde, Marseilles, France', 'Tuesday June 4th started work at 8AM finished at 11AM took our bit ashore in the afternoon. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('7DA40CF7-D543-4669-892A-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-04 18:30:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Marseilles, France', 'Left the SS Ormonde at 6.30PM went on board the SS Indarra at 7.30PM. Very rough sleeping quarters, we slept on the floors and tables and on deck in fact anywhere. 32 men told off for table with room only for 16 men for meals. We have our meals in two sitting 16 each. Some hope we shall soon leave this ship we seem in for a rough time. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8EA98653-EE86-4B46-892B-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-05 06:30:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Marseilles, France', 'Breakfast 7.30AM everybody complaining. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('456D2BC5-D7A1-441C-892C-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-05 13:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Marseilles, France', 'A lot of French troops come aboard this afternoon. Parade at 2PM with lifebelts for boat drill and inspection.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('E350E787-8AE4-4723-892D-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-05 15:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'June 5th left Marseilles at 4 PM, anchored just outside the harbour. For night I slept on deck under the stars and on the Mediterranean Sea on a lovely June night. A lot of fighting amongst the crew 2 fight on shore and 2 on board a very good start. One of the crews running about the deck with a damn great knife looking for trouble', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('E0842D69-5DE2-429A-892E-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-06 22:15:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Thursday June 6th laid outside the harbour all day. Had boat drill and told off to our boat stations and left Marseilles for good or see. At 11.15 PM escorted by eight Japanese Destroyers we have five big troop ship in our convoy.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('1C496A7B-C20E-44C9-892F-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-07 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Friday June 7th started work and worked until dinner time then told off to work in steward’s department.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('10C5A10A-AAFD-42A0-8930-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-08 21:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'June 8th I took charge of the officer’s bathroom to assist the bedroom steward I slept in the bathroom had a splendid bed, had all my food in first class pantry. I am still going on alright the sea is a bit choppy. Siren sounded 4 blasts at 10PM we all got the wind up thought old Fritzy had got us but it turned out to be a signal to the other boats.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('25C5F741-AA54-4271-8931-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-09 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Sunday June 9th sea very rough feeling a bit seasick but not very bad yet. We expect to reach Malta today.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('9E1F9389-BD13-4D89-8932-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-09 18:30:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Malta', 'Sunday we have arrived at Malta at 7.30PM after a fairly rough passage 10 Destroyers with us.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('E086F129-D7D0-4883-8933-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-10 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Malta', 'Monday June 10th stayed in Malta harbour all day.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('72AC6233-9718-4DEE-8934-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-11 13:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Tuesday June 11th left Malta at 2.00 PM.  ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('39124EC0-5741-4537-8935-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-12 05:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Wednesday June 12th sighted a submarine at 6.00 AM', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('34D9C72B-4573-45A2-8936-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-12 05:10:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Jap Destroyer sank her at 6.10 AM. We saw some sharks in the sea close to our boat the sea is very calm like a lake. We saw a big ship at night lighted up looks like a hospital ship, but a lot of our chaps has got the wind up and won’t go below but must sleep or walk about the decks with lifebelts on. I am still in the best of health. Order out that all port holes to be closed night and day and all watertight compartments closed.  We are now in the most dangerous part, 2 big ships lost here last week. Not yet got the wind up.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('D2483A0D-0298-48D0-8937-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-13 14:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'Thursday June 13th an unlucky number, I hope it will be lucky this time.  The sea is like a mill pond lovely and smooth we hope to reach Alexandria tomorrow, Friday, if all goes well everybody on board is very anxious and a lot of them has got the wind up. I changed into my thin drill clothes today feel a lot cooler and better. We were all inoculated again at 3PM that makes 3 times in less than 2 months.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8BC915E7-F666-4652-8938-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-13 15:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra', 'It is 4PM now and the Japs have just opened fire on a submarine we cannot see the result from our ship. Jap signalled have sunk sub with depth charges.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('4F41D2C2-06A0-499E-8939-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-14 10:00:00.0000000', 'SS Indarra, Alexandria ', 'Friday June 14th arrived safely at Alexandria at 11AM after a terrible exciting time a whole lot of German submarines just outside the harbour waiting for us we had a very big escort come out to meet us 2 seaplanes, 1 aeroplane, 1 balloon and about 20 war vessels of different kinds not including our own escort of 10 destroyers the Japs sank 3 subs in less than ½ an hour. We saw two blown right up out of the water. That made 5 submarines sunk on our Journey from Malta to Alexandria not so bad as they meant to have us but the Japs were too smart for them.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8EFDCB1C-5266-4A47-893A-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-14 19:00:00.0000000', 'Alexandria', 'We left the SS Indarra at 8PM ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('83C60444-BEA3-4922-893B-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-14 20:00:00.0000000', 'Dessert', 'and left Alexandria at 9PM. Travelling all night in the train through the dessert where it was very hot in fact in the daytime you could not bear your hand to touch the side of the carriage. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('4CE49608-2EB8-4143-893C-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-15 10:00:00.0000000', 'Port Suez', 'We arrived at Port Suez at 11AM on June 15th.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B6736D74-14E4-4218-893D-08DE03520F77', '1918-06-15 14:30:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'Went on board the SS Willochra and left Suez at 3.30PM. Passing though the Red Sea we saw the mountains on which Noah’s ark rested after the flood and mount Sinai where Moses wrote the 10 Commandments. These we saw on the Arabian coast on the other side the Egyptian coast we saw the monument marking the spot where children of Israel walked through the Red Sea.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('99803D96-2ED6-4AC3-1F79-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-16 07:15:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'Sunday June 16th I am told off for fatigue at 8.15AM this is not such a good ship as the SS Indarra was to us.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('414E1492-01E2-464A-1F7A-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-18 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 18th started work in the pantry. Plenty of good food and plenty of work.  ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('DDE798F3-0483-4DA4-1F7B-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-20 09:30:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 20th reached Aden 10.30, anchored outside harbour very hot here but a very nice breeze blowing. We were nearly five days passing through the Red Sea.  We passed through Hells Gate ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('982A91C6-1CD6-4F16-1F7C-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-20 13:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 20th left Aden at 2PM ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('A3C9B79E-DF29-475A-1F7D-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-21 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 21st In the Indian Ocean, very hot here not much breeze now seeing a lot of flying fish. The day very quiet nothing doing only the ocean to look upon. Wrote a letter home but missed the mail so must send it later on we passed Somaliland ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('C9223B67-D9CB-4C84-1F7E-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-22 20:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 22nd saw the Southern Cross in the sky very clearly.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('9EB877C2-EEF1-487D-1F7F-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-22 22:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'Saturday June 22nd very strong wind blowing and the sea very rough most of our boys are seasick. Feeling a bit queer myself afraid I am in for a rough time this time', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('F1CB6C89-D760-4125-1F80-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-23 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'Sunday June 23rd sea still very rough not got me down yet. Very near though but still at work. Both my mates sick. It is Sunday today I feel a bit down again always am on Sundays for I think of our Sunday in old England', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('540EE8F2-3394-4C1E-1F81-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-24 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 24th the sea is a bit more calm this morning. A quiet day crossed the line in the afternoon', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B2A36509-8EA7-4843-1F82-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-25 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 25th quiet day', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('CBB9D02E-AFAE-4C06-1F83-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-26 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra', 'June 26th quiet day sea much calmer. Concert in the evening turned out to be a good one.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8913A597-6A93-4496-1F84-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-27 02:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Mombasa, Kenya', 'June 27th Reached Mombasa 3AM.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B84E2819-5B3E-4DCE-1F85-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-27 06:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Kilindini, Mombasa, Kenya', 'Waited outside harbour entered into Kilindini at 7.0AM when the KAR (King’s African Rifles) disembarked on lighters as we could not get to the quayside.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('69540925-ED2D-439D-1F86-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-27 15:30:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Mombasa, Kenya', 'We left Kilindini 4.30PM', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('A14A63FB-1ACE-4654-1F87-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-27 08:15:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Kilindini, Mombasa, Kenya', 'Hospital ship Gareon came into harbour at 9.15AM', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('CB56C299-8687-4B66-1F88-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-28 09:30:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Dar es Salaam ', 'June 28th arrived outside Dar es Salaam 10.30AM. Had to wait all day and night until 7AM for the tide before entering harbour.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('F565033B-FF2F-4BE0-1F89-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-28 16:30:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Dar es Salaam ', 'British cruiser came alongside at 5.30PM and laid outside the Harbour.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('4F96943F-C86C-461A-1F8A-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-29 05:15:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Dar es Salaam ', 'June 29th Cruiser left at 6.15AM.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('FF73BF7A-6D72-49C1-1F8B-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-29 06:15:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Dar es Salaam ', 'We entered Dar es Salaam harbour at 7.15 AM.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('BBFD5E2F-44D1-45F1-1F8C-08DE035E87B1', '1918-06-29 09:00:00.0000000', 'SS Willochra, Dar es Salaam ', 'Disembarked about 10AM. Marched to the JWT camp for a rest and to be reclassified for different stations along the coast ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('3E28FE19-FFA4-454B-26B5-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-03 16:30:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Dar es Salaam ', 'July 3rd left camp to go on Board SS Umtata as cheeber with four other pals at 5.30PM to remain on board living and sleeping as second class passengers. Nice clean cabin 5 & 6 course breakfast coffee in bed at 6AM, luncheon at 1.30PM, afternoon tea at 4PM, late 6 or 7 Course dinner at 7PM. We are to stay on board for trips up and down the coast.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('4177F8DE-DFF9-4241-26B6-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-06 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Dar es Salaam ', 'Saturday July 6th started to load in the evening', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('CD9F0B1A-E208-4EA0-26B7-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-09 10:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Dar es Salaam ', 'Tuesday July 9th finished boarding and sailed for Zanzibar about 11AM arrived. ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('8A07FBF4-A567-41EB-26B8-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-09 15:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Zanzibar', 'At Zanzibar 4PM July ', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B4FA5B50-C9A7-43E6-26B9-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-10 21:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Zanzibar', 'Wednesday July 10th had ½ day on shore, 3 days holiday for the natives. We had a fine time ashore we saw their fair, also had good look round the town Beer 2\= a pint. Had whisky and sodas at 10’ a drink. More than you get in old England for 2\=. arrived back on board at 10PM perfectly sober.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('14FED862-54DB-4789-26BA-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-10 22:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Zanzibar', 'July 10th to 14th ship took on coal and water. Women working on the coal barges.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('D4043A56-2751-4BFF-26BB-08DE039E9AD3', '1918-07-15 05:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Zanzibar', 'July 15th left Zanzibar at 6AM for ports down the coast first call Lindi', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('13EED214-9251-4DB4-2BEF-08DE04115F16', '1918-07-16 11:15:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Lindi', 'July 16th we arrived at Lindi at 12.15PM took black troops on board in the afternoon and almost 120 white troops making 1700 altogether.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('B8D96DD6-A830-4EA9-2BF0-08DE04115F16', '1918-07-17 10:45:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Mikidani', 'July 17th left Lindi at 8AM passed Mikindani at 11.45AM. Saw 2 Black men flogged on the deck. Made to lay on the deck with their trousers off and receive 10 lashes each with a Kaboko (raw hippo hide)', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('9FB183D5-752D-40FC-2BF1-08DE04115F16', '1918-07-19 06:45:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Lumbo', 'July 19th passed Mozambique at 7.15AM, arrived at Lumbo 7.45AM. Disembarked troops and started to unload cargo', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('E91DC297-1CE5-49F9-2BF2-08DE04115F16', '1918-07-20 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Lumbo ', 'July 20th went ashore in the afternoon walked round the camp and nearly had to stay on shore all night but just managed to get back on board. We had a sing song in the evening on deck. Plenty of Whisky and Cigars.', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')
insert into DiaryEntry values ('130DBFD6-C1F5-4BAF-2BF3-08DE04115F16', '1918-07-22 11:00:00.0000000', 'SS Umtata, Lumbo ', 'July 22nd Ship baker laid up with bad foot no bread on board. Served out with ships biscuits and they are as hard as bricks', '61625950-9C26-46EF-1B98-08DD14BC2509')